     1728   MAIN-BLOCK:
     1729   DO ON ERROR   UNDO MAIN-BLOCK, LEAVE MAIN-BLOCK
     1730      ON END-KEY UNDO MAIN-BLOCK, LEAVE MAIN-BLOCK:
     1731     if lookup ("b-lkp", parbtn) > 0 then do:
     1732       enable b-lkp with frame Dialog-Frame.
     1733     end.
     1734     if lookup ("b-add", parbtn) > 0 then do:
     1735       enable b-add with frame Dialog-Frame.
     1736     end.
     1737     if lookup ("b-chg", parbtn) > 0 then do:
     1738       enable b-chg with frame Dialog-Frame.
     1739     end.
     1740     if lookup ("b-del", parbtn) > 0 then do:
     1741       enable b-del with frame Dialog-Frame.
